<title>USA: Schering-Plough sets split, raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Schering-Plough sets split, raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, N.J. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schering-Plough Corp said Tuesday its board had authorized a two-for-one stock split and a 15 percent increase in the quarterly dividend.</p>
<p>The pharmaceutical company said the board voted to increase the number of authorized common shares from 600 million to 1.2 billion to reflect the split.</p>
<p>As of March 31, there were 365.9 million common shares outstanding, it said.</p>
<p>The quarterly dividend will rise to $0.38 a share from $0.33 on pre-split shares, the company said, payable May 27, record May 2.</p>
</text>
